<title>FINLAND: CHIPS SEES SATISFACTORY FULL-YR RESULT.</title>
<headline>CHIPS SEES SATISFACTORY FULL-YR RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish snacks and food group AB Chips Oy Ltd said in a statement on Friday it expected its full-year 1996 result to be satisfactory.</p>
<p>&quot;Expectations are that we will retain during the second half of the year our profitability, which will give us a satisfactory full-year 1996 result,&quot; Chips said in its January-June interim report, referring to a 12 percent jump in half-year net profit to 33.9 million markka.</p>
</text>
